				"integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Cinematic science-fiction, live-action and high-detail CG, 16:9 widescreen composition. A silver passenger train travels along a transparent track suspended in deep space. Colorful nebula clouds surround distant planets. The camera tracks beside the train at fast speed while blue light moves across its reflective exterior.\n\n[Shot 2] At 00:02.400, the camera cuts inside a quiet observation carriage. A young woman in a white futuristic uniform sits beside a panoramic window, holding an old paper photograph. The camera pushes in with small amplitude at slow speed as a ringed planet passes behind her.\n\n[Shot 3] At 00:05.100, the camera cuts to her POV through the window. An enormous luminous space creature rises from the nebula and swims beside the train. Its translucent body contains moving stars and galaxies.\n\n[Shot 4] At 00:07.500, the camera cuts to an extreme wide exterior shot. The creature curves around the train, guiding it into a circular portal of golden light. The train and creature enter the portal together, leaving a long trail of glowing particles before the portal closes.\n\noverall_soundscape: A low train vibration continues beneath soft mechanical clicks inside the carriage. Deep resonant calls travel through space as the creature approaches, followed by a broad energy surge when the portal opens.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: Slow piano chords are joined by sustained synthesizer pads and low orchestral strings. A bright brass swell rises as the train enters the portal and fades with the remaining particles.",
